  "narrative": {
    "text": "A screenshot of the whole example graph in a graph editor, zoomed out so that most labels are not legible at the extracted resolution. The legible nodes include HarvestAction 'Mine Graphite', BulkHardware 'Graphite' (gold), Organization 'Graphite Mineing LLD', PhysicalLocation 'Mine Site A', TransportAction 'Transport to Train' and 'Train To Siding 341A', PhysicalLocation 'Load Terminal #4' and 'Siding 341A', two ResponsibilityChange nodes, Organizations 'Safe Trucking LTD', 'KJ Trains LTD' and 'Carbon Graph Inc', a UnitOfMeasure node, a CreationInfo node, a Regulation node joined to an ExternalIdentifier node, a second gold BulkHardware node at the top, and many Relationship nodes. A vertical toolbar of icons runs down the left edge and a collapse button sits at the upper right.",
